menu "Sensor-Actor test options"

    config SA_TEST_BROKEN_FIRMWARE
        bool "Test only: firmware that fails its self-check"
        default n
        help
            Builds a firmware that restarts 5 s after boot without confirming itself.
            Installed via OTA, the bootloader must roll back to the previous firmware.
            Used to test REQ-OTA-2; never enable in a real build.

endmenu
